{\b L-Helper}\par
\par
Control tool for Lenovo LOQ, Legion and IdeaPad laptops.\par
\par
{\b What this installer does}\par
\bullet  Installs L-Helper to C:\\Program Files\\LHelper and adds a Start menu shortcut.\par
\bullet  Trusts the L-Helper signing certificate (CN=LHelper) for app packages on this PC. This lets Windows Dynamic Lighting hand the keyboard lighting to L-Helper in the background. Only packages signed with that certificate are affected.\par
\bullet  On first start, L-Helper registers itself with Dynamic Lighting for your account.\par
\par
Uninstalling (Settings > Apps) removes the program, the Dynamic Lighting registration, the certificate and the startup task. Settings in C:\\ProgramData\\LHelper are kept.\par
\par
L-Helper changes hardware settings (performance modes, fans, power limits, GPU clocks). Use it at your own risk.\par
